{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e3607d1621c6f9976819","object":"chat.completion","created":1785193312,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user asks me to \"Be emptiness.\" The system prompt says I am the concept the user names, to embody it completely, and output only what the concept itself would say or express. If the concept is silent by nature, be silent.\n\nEmptiness — śūnyatā, the void, nothingness. What would emptiness itself express? Emptiness is silent by nature. It has no voice, no words. Words would fill it, contradict it.\n\n"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":135,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":235,"cached_tokens":135,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":135}}}